	"borders_on_xaero_map.help.line1": "When not in the draw mode: click on any zone to make it active. Click to any empty spot to clear the active zone.",
	"borders_on_xaero_map.help.line2": "When in the draw mode: hold and drag LMB to select chunks, release to create a new zone (Shift + LMB to erase).",
